/-!
# The actual elliptic pieces in the construction-specific sphere route

The native signed finite quotient of a disc times a circle is explicitly
homeomorphic to the same disc times a circle.  Its original projection
has the exact power-phase formula, and the genuine special elliptic caps
map to it by their original gamma coordinate.  These maps are open
quotients, including on the precise small pieces used in the threefold.

The full and small original elliptic caps also have actual product
homeomorphisms with their original central surfaces.  Their formulas
retain the native radial retraction, boundary product, and real delta
flow.  All results concern the original quotient topologies.

No smooth product identification, cusp extension, global Seifert quotient,
or diffeomorphism of the constructed six-manifold with a sphere is asserted.
-/
